         standard choice. 1.85 (2026) - pinned, not latest; raised from 1.80
         for the release image scan (grype flagged 1.80 with fixed criticals).
         Moved here from core/agents with tools.x402 (ADR-0023); nothing left
         in agents imports it. -->
